[{"result":{"data":{"json":{"id":"937","stub":{"id":"937","section":"Hwy.28 (in Ewen) to W Br Ontonagon (26.5 miles)","altname":"","river":"Ontonagon, S.Br.","difficulty":"ItoIII","states":["USA-MCH"]},"primaryGaugeStatus":null,"pointOfInterests":[{"type":"put-in","description":null,"id":"111756","location":{"latitude":"46.5346","longitude":"-89.2767"},"name":"Put In","distance":"0","photoID":null,"difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false},{"type":"rapid","description":"Flannigan Rapids appears to be a low-grade (class I-II) boulderbed rapids which starts here and runs fairly continuous for nearly two miles. It appears possible one could hike (about 3/4-mile) in to this point off of Burma Road (730). Look for a logging trail (likely gated/impassible) about 2.25 miles South of where it bends to head South, or about 0.6 mile North of N.Cemetery Road. You would have to hike in about 0.4 mile to where the trail is nearest the woods, but where it veers away for a bit. At this point, look for a path of least resistance due West (more-or-less) into the trees. You will hit the river within a quarter-mile, and be pretty much right at the head of the rapids!","id":"14014","location":{"latitude":"46.60749816894531","longitude":"-89.29280090332031"},"name":"Flannigan Rapids","distance":"9.09","difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false,"photoID":"0"},{"type":"takeout","description":null,"id":"117028","location":{"latitude":"46.6869","longitude":"-89.2296"},"name":"Take Out","distance":"26.5","photoID":null,"difficulty":"N/A","approximate":false}],"alerts":[],"photos":[],"detail":{"id":"937","permitUrl":"","permitInfo":"","description":"The first **nine miles** of this reach appear to be **totally flatwater**, until **Flannigan Rapids** is reached. From here down to the confluence with the W Br, there is an average gradient of 15'/mile, creating low grade rapids.\n\nTo reach a take-out, one must paddle at least 2.25 miles across a flowage (behind the Victoria Falls dam). This is not reflected in the gradient figures, though it is reflected by the take-out coordinates (for shuttle routing to work correctly).","averageGradient":"8","maxGradient":"31","length":"26.4","correlations":[],"pointOfInterestIDs":["111756","14014","117028"],"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[-89.27679487780787,46.53471813459815],[-89.2765687718649,46.53489972776856],[-89.2762369051988,46.53533372776786],[-89.27626917186541,46.53583639443378],[-89.27712777186406,46.537093794431826],[-89.27719297186394,46.53764232776433],[-89.2770601051975,46.53791639443057],[-89.2767949051979,46.53814459443021],[-89.27590037186599,46.538349527763216],[-89.27580070519946,46.53853232776294],[-89.27623050519878,46.53892112776231],[-89.27834710519551,46.54045392775993],[-89.27867797186167,46.54061412775969],[-89.27900917186116,46.540637194426324],[-89.28043310519229,46.540592594426414],[-89.28069777185851,46.54072999442616],[-89.28079690519172,46.54086719442597],[-89.2807963051917,46.54123272775871],[-89.28069657185853,46.54141539442509],[-89.27980157185993,46.54200879442419],[-89.27980070519322,46.54246592775684],[-89.28019777185932,46.542626194423235],[-89.2819859718565,46.54269612775647],[-89.2828465718552,46.54294812775606],[-89.28314430518805,46.54310832775582],[-89.28311070518811,46.543359727755444],[-89.28294510518839,46.543473794421914],[-89.28231577185602,46.54347332775524],[-89.28062670519193,46.54349479442186],[-89.28012950519275,46.54379152775476],[-89.28016210519269,46.544065727754344],[-89.28036050519239,46.544248594420715],[-89.28088990519154,46.54450039442031],[-89.28271070518872,46.54489032775309],[-89.28370357185383,46.54530239441908],[-89.28400117185339,46.545553994418704],[-89.2840009718534,46.54566819441851],[-89.28390130518687,46.54589672775148],[-89.28356977185406,46.54607919441787],[-89.28161530519044,46.54637472775073],[-89.28121757185772,46.54653432775052],[-89.28088590519155,46.546853994416665],[-89.28055397185875,46.547356394415885],[-89.28015490519273,46.